!!! 05-records-and-choices.matrix
!!! Records (Ny structs), choices (Ny enums), type aliases and generics.
!!!
!!! Every construction initialises every declared field exactly once. There is
!!! no field-default spelling, because Ny rejects field defaults and a
!!! "field x as integer is 37" line would read exactly like a working one.

book tour.shapes

Point begin record
    field x as number
    field y as number
end record

!!! Nested record fields hold nominally typed object handles. Updating one
!!! through a field or a reference is visible through its other aliases; this
!!! is shared handle behaviour, not by-value copying.
Segment begin record
    field start  as Point
    field finish as Point
end record

!!! A generic record. Only concrete instantiations with supported field
!!! layouts are executed.
Envelope of type T begin record
    field item as T
end record

!!! A type alias.
Coordinate means number

!!! A choice with typed payloads.
JobState begin choice
    when Queued   holding number
    when Running  holding number
    when Complete holding number
    when Failed   holding number
end choice

!!! A choice with a unit variant and a generic parameter. The standard library
!!! already supplies Option and Result; redeclaring them in an application is
!!! a mistake in Matrix for the same reason it is in Ny.
Maybe of type T begin choice
    when Present holding T
    when Absent
end choice

describe receives state as JobState returns text begin paragraph
    consider state
        when JobState.Queued   holding ticket  then give "queued"
        when JobState.Running  holding percent then give "running"
        when JobState.Complete holding records then give "complete"
        when JobState.Failed   holding code provided code is at least 500 then give "server failure"
        when JobState.Failed   holding code then give "client failure"
        otherwise give "unknown"
    end consider
end paragraph

main returns number begin paragraph

    value origin is build Point with x being 0, y being 0
    value corner is build Point with x being 3, y being 4
    say corner.x

    value span is build Segment with start being origin, finish being corner
    say span.finish.y

    value boxed is build Envelope of number with item being 42
    say boxed.item

    value here as Coordinate is 7
    say here

    say describe with state being (JobState.Queued holding 41)
    say describe with state being (JobState.Failed holding 503)

    value found as Maybe of number is Maybe.Present holding 42
    consider found
        when Maybe.Present holding payload then say payload
        when Maybe.Absent then say "no value"
    end consider

    give 0
end paragraph
